  {
   "pageDisplayName": "About",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": true,
     "text": "<font size='40'><p align='center'>The Living Commonwealth</p></font>"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": true,
     "text": "<p align='center'>An F4SE plugin that makes the Commonwealth <i>live</i> — every settler a mind with needs, bonds, jobs, illnesses, and a life. Built on the Living Commonwealth Engine (LCE).</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": true,
     "text": "<p align='center'>Settings apply within a second of a change — the sim hot-applies them. The INI next to the plugin remains the source of truth; this page is its in-game face.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": true,
     "text": "<p align='center'>The Commonwealth remembers: save, quit, reload — the world keeps its bonds, its caps, and its stories.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": true,
     "text": "<p align='center'>Chaos with a seed is just a story that repeats itself politely.</p>"
    }
   ]
  }
